// src/v4/compiler/05_eval.dag
// Scope: primary evaluation path over inferred tree/input subgraphs and TestClaim runner substrate.
// Status: T-22 eval and TestClaim runner consume decomposed runtime interpretation algebra. Local control terminalization, runtime-value conformance, behavior dispatch, Outcome accumulation, and fold progress sentinels are staged below with explicit dissolution targets.
// CompilesClaim: run_test_claim_runtime_assert compares actual to expected_value through runtime evaluation (tighter than legacy AssertKind Compiles, which Pass'd on any Accepted).

